  "answer_text": "Great news \u2014 **Miraculous Ladybug Season 2, Episode 12 has already aired!** It is not a future release. Here are the details depending on which episode list you're referring to (episode numbering can vary by region):\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udc1e If going by the **official/production order** \u2014 *\"Sapotis\"*\nIn this episode, while Marinette and Alya are having a sleepover, Alya's little sisters Etta and Ella get into trouble and are akumatized by Hawk Moth, becoming the Sapotis \u2014 small, out-of-control monsters who multiply upon eating and wreak havoc across the city. Overwhelmed and outnumbered, Ladybug calls on a new superhero \u2014 she chooses Alya and entrusts her with the Fox Miraculous, turning her into Rena Rouge, the fox superheroine!\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udc1e If going by the **English broadcast/Netflix order** \u2014 *\"Gorizilla\"*\nThis episode aired on **May 13, 2018**, and features Adrien's bodyguard getting akumatized into Gorizilla, who \u2014 endowed with extraordinary strength and an acute sense of smell \u2014 tracks Adrien all through Paris.\n\n---\n\nSo, **both versions of Season 2, Episode 12 have already been released** \u2014 the earliest airing was back in **2018**. You can watch them now on platforms like **Disney+** or **Netflix**! \ud83d\udc1e\ud83d\udc31",
